<div class="container">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <span class="text-primary fw-semibold fs-6 d-block mb-3" style="font-family: IBM Plex Mono;">Visualização em tempo real</span>
      <div class="card border shadow-sm overflow-hidden rounded-3">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
            <span class="badge text-bg-primary fw-bold text-uppercase" id="preview-category">Website</span>
            <span class="small text-muted" id="preview-deadline">Prazo: 1 Mês</span>
          </div>

          <h5 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3" id="preview-title">Novo Projeto</h5>

          <p class="card-text text-secondary mb-3" id="preview-problem">
            <em>Nenhum problema informado ainda. Responda ao questionário para visualizar o resumo aqui.</em>
          </p>

          <ul class="list-group list-group-flush small mb-3">
            <li class="list-group-item px-0 d-flex justify-content-between">
                <span class="text-muted">Público-alvo:</span>
                <span class="fw-semibold text-end" id="preview-public">Clientes</span>
            </li>
            <li class="list-group-item px-0 d-flex justify-content-between">
              <span class="text-muted">Plataformas:</span>
              <span class="fw-semibold text-end" id="preview-platforms">Web</span>
            </li>
            <li class="list-group-item px-0 d-flex justify-content-between">
              <span class="text-muted">Linguagem:</span>
              <span class="fw-semibold text-end" id="preview-language">Python</span>
            </li>
            <li class="list-group-item px-0 d-flex justify-content-between">
              <span class="text-muted">Orçamento:</span>
              <span class="fw-semibold text-end text-success" id="preview-budget">A definir</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="bg-light-subtle p-3 rounded-2 fs-7">
            <div class="fw-bold mb-1 text-body-tertiary">Ações requeridas do usuário:</div>
            <div class="text-muted" id="preview-actions">Ainda não especificado.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
